### **Summary of Key Risks**
| **Risk** | **Severity (0-1)** | **Primary Concern** |
|----------|-------------------|---------------------|
| Reduced visibility | 0.9 | Collision with unseen objects |
| Right-turn collision | 0.85 | Misjudging yellow car movement |
| Hydroplaning | 0.75 | Loss of vehicle control |
| Pedestrian crossing | 0.8 | Undetected pedestrians |
| Traffic light misinterpretation | 0.85 | Incorrect stopping/proceeding |

This scene represents a **high-risk corner case** due to **adverse weather conditions**, requiring **enhanced sensor fusion, predictive collision avoidance, and adaptive speed control** in autonomous driving systems.